WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.167
-Well, guys, it seems like

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:04.036
there's so much going on
right now.

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:06.672
Supreme Court justice Stephen
Breyer is stepping down.

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:10.076
Everyone's talking about
"Encanto."

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:14.581
A winter hurricane might be
headed for the East Coast.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:18.451
And Pizza Hut just released
its spiciest pizza ever.

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.620
Let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.889
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:24.724
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.459
♪♪

00:00:27.459 --> 00:00:29.261
First up, Justice Breyer.

00:00:29.261 --> 00:00:32.398
He's retiring after nearly
30 years on the Supreme Court.

00:00:32.398 --> 00:00:35.201
Democrats are already talking
about who should replace him.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.237
But you know who
they're not talking about?

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:39.372
Bruno.

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.273
"Encanto" is huge right now.

00:00:41.273 --> 00:00:43.943
It's got an amazing soundtrack
by Lin-Manuel Miranda,

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:45.344
and two of the songs
are currently

00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:47.047
in the Billboard Top 10.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.014
The music is rocking everyone
like a...

00:00:49.014 --> 00:00:50.850
hurricane.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.686
That's right. A bomb cyclone
with the power of a hurricane

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.555
is headed for the Northeast.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:56.889
And if you want to experience

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:59.359
your own personal bomb cyclone,
why not try...

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:02.361
Pizza Hut's new
Spicy Lover's Pizza?

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:04.330
It's their spiciest pizza ever.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.699
With red jalapeños
and chili peppers.

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:08.568
It will mess you up so bad,
you'll have to...

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.870
retire.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.339
Whoever fills Breyer's seat
will be stuck in that role

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:15.007
for years to come.

00:01:15.007 --> 00:01:16.909
Speaking of things
getting stuck for years,

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:18.411
the "Encanto" soundtrack.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:21.513
We're gonna be singing
these songs for a long time.

00:01:21.513 --> 00:01:22.816
It's basically the new...

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:24.450
"Frozen."

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.953
To prepare, people are stocking
up on water and toilet paper,

00:01:27.953 --> 00:01:31.091
but not because of the storm,
because they just tried...

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:34.160
Pizza Hut's new
Spicy Lover's Pizza.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.729
In conclusion, time to go...

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.331
let it snow...

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:39.966
get that dough...

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:42.635
♪ We don't talk about Bruno,
no, no, no ♪

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:44.904
This has been a "News Smash."

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:47.607
[ Cheers and applause ]

